# ShopSphere does not need any secrets to run.
# All product, order and user data is served from local mock JSON files in /public/data
# and persisted in the browser's localStorage.
#
# If you later connect a real backend, keep secrets on the SERVER side only.
# Angular bundles everything in src/ into public JavaScript, so never put API keys there.
#
# Example values a future backend/BFF might use (not read by the frontend):
# SHOPSPHERE_API_URL=https://api.example.com
# PAYMENT_PROVIDER_SECRET_KEY=sk_live_xxx   # server-only
